--[[
    SAR UI - full feature demo

    Uses every element and every window function in the library:
      elements : Label, Paragraph, Divider, Button, Toggle, Slider, Dropdown (single + multi),
                 Input (text / numeric / multiline), Keybind, ColorPicker, Section (collapsible + nested)
      window   : Tab, Channel, SelectTab, Notify, Dialog, Toggle, SetTheme, SetAccent, SetTransparency,
                 SetTitle, SetProfile, SetProfileVisible, SaveConfig, LoadConfig, DeleteConfig,
                 ListConfigs, GetFlag, CreateSettingsTab, Destroy
      library  : SAR:AddTheme, SAR:Notify, SAR:DestroyAll
      layout   : left rail (tabs + extras), channels + pages + profile (middle), right rail (quick buttons)

    The Player / World / Teleport tabs do real things (speed, jump, noclip, fov, fullbright, teleport, spectate).
    RightShift hides / shows the UI.
]]

